WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:06.431
Simex pro. Project management is not learned from a manual. It is lived.

2
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:14.339
You steer a complete project, from the sponsor brief to the final debrief, with a team that reacts to your decisions.

3
00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:23.606
Pick a scenario: construction, information technology, healthcare, finance. Every project starts with a realistic team and budget.

4
00:00:23.908 --> 00:00:33.765
Round after round, you meet your simulated participants, trade off budget against quality, and handle the unexpected. Every decision moves the indicators.

5
00:00:34.911 --> 00:00:42.958
At the end, a report calibrated on the PMI standard: overall score, five dimensions, concrete recommendations.

6
00:00:43.913 --> 00:00:49.708
A growing catalogue: beginner, intermediate, advanced, across some twenty sectors.

7
00:00:52.914 --> 00:00:58.813
A free plan to get started, plans in Canadian dollars to go further, no credit card needed.

8
00:01:00.931 --> 00:01:04.122
Join the pilot program at simex-pro dot com.
